## 3. TECHNICAL ARCHITECTURE & RUNNING COSTS
* **Frontend Web Ecosystem:** **Next.js 15 (React)** with Tailwind CSS - Ultra-fast, mobile-responsive interface optimized for low-data mobile networks.
* **Unified Backend & Database:** **Node.js (NestJS)** + **PostgreSQL** hosted on **Railway**, ensuring a single source of truth across all three hubs.
* **Payments & Media:** **Paystack** for online collections + **Cloudflare R2** for product images and waybill/invoice documents.
* **Third-Party Operational Costs (Paid Directly by Client):** Cloud server/DB hosting (~$10-$15/mo on Railway), custom domain (~₦15,000/yr), and standard 1.5% capped Paystack processing fees.

